摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Cross-agent plugin for manually excluding and editing AI conversation context, with search, filtering, hide/restore, undo, and original Session preservation.","id":"gh:1337799906","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"agent-context-editor","slug":"jermaine123123/agent-context-editor","topics":["agent-tools","ai-agent","ai-agents","coding-agent","context-editor","context-engineering","context-management","conversation-editor","conversation-management","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","llm-agent","pi-coding-agent","session-management","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Cross-agent plugin for manually excluding and editing AI conversation context, with search, filterin"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"g, hide/restore, undo, and original Session preservation."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Agent Context Editor"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Agent Context Editor is a cross-agent plugin for manually excluding, editing, and selectively compre"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ssing AI conversation context. It also supports searching, filtering, selecting, hiding, restoring, "},{"id":"p3s3","text":"and undoing conversation changes while preserving the original Session."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"It provides a consistent, reversible, and user-controlled context-management option across supported"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" Agent hosts, complementing prompt steering and automatic context compaction rather than replacing t"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"nt hosts, complementing prompt steering and automatic context compaction rather than replacing them."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"中文说明: README.zh-CN.md"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Usage guidance"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Long-running Agent sessions can suffer from **context rot**: as the context grows—especially when fa"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"iled attempts, stale conclusions, and irrelevant Tool output accumulate—the model may become less re"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"liable at finding and correctly applying important information even before the context window is ful"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"able at finding and correctly applying important information even before the context window is full."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"For most tasks, prompt steering and automatic context compaction are usually sufficient. Manual cont"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ext exclusion and editing are optional controls for cases where the automatic result is not what you"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" want, rather than something users need to manage continuously. They can be useful when compaction d"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"rops details worth preserving or when failed attempts and irrelevant history occupy too much of the "},{"id":"p8s5","text":"ails worth preserving or when failed attempts and irrelevant history occupy too much of the context."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"> **Prompt-cache impact:** Excluding or editing context changes the model-input prefix. Cached promp"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"t content after the earliest changed position may no longer be reusable, so changes near the end of "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"a Session usually affect less cached context than changes near the beginning. Exact behavior depends"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" on the Agent host, model, and provider. The original Session remains preserved."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- Manually exclude selected context and restore it later\n- Edit User messages and AI Answers with re"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"store and undo\n- AI-condense selected context into an editable, reversible summary(selectively compr"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"essing)\n- Search conversations and navigate between matches\n- Filter User, AI, Reasoning, Answer, an"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"d Tool content\n- Select individual items, continuous ranges, or multiple items\n- Hide, restore, rese"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"t, and undo visual changes\n- Manage AI Reasoning and final Answers independently\n- Save changes with"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"out overwriting the original Session\n- Automatically use a Chinese or English interface"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Supported hosts"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Feature | Pi TUI | Pi Desktop/RPC | DeepSeek Harness |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| Search and f"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ilters | Yes | Yes | Yes |\n| Single, range, and batch selection | Yes | Yes | Yes |\n| Independent Re"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"asoning and Answer units | Yes | Yes | Yes |\n| Visual hide, restore, reset, and undo | Yes | Yes | Y"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"es |\n| Manual context exclusion | Yes | No | Yes |\n| Manual User/Answer editing | Yes | No | Yes |\n|"},{"id":"p13s5","text":" AI condensation and replacement | Yes | No | Yes |\n| Original Session preserved | Yes | Yes | Yes |"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"\n| Chinese and English UI | Yes | Yes | Yes |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Manual context exclusion, text editing, and selected-context AI condensation are available in Pi TUI"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" and DeepSeek Harness. Editable content is limited to plain-text User messages and complete unsigned"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"Seek Harness. Editable content is limited to plain-text User messages and complete unsigned Answers."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The separate Pi Context Desktop community build provides visual conversation management for Windows "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"separate Pi Context Desktop community build provides visual conversation management for Windows x64."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Pi extension"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Download `pi-context-editor-0.6.1.tgz` from the release assets. Pi `0.84.2` installs a local package"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" directory rather than a `.tgz` file. Extract the archive so that `package.json` is at the package d"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"irectory root, then run:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"When working directly from this repository:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"For Pi Desktop registration, run `adapters/pi-extension/scripts/install-desktop.ps1` with PowerShell"},{"id":"p22s2","text":". The script accepts `-PiPath` and `-DesktopExePath` for non-standard installations. Fully restart P"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"i Desktop after installation."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Download `context-editor-deepseek-harness-0.4.10.tgz` from the release assets and install it with th"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"e official Harness CLI:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The adapter has been tested with DeepSeek Harness `0.1.5-rc.1` and an isolated `0.1.6-alpha.1` build"},{"id":"p26s2","text":". See COMPATIBILITY.md for the tested host boundaries."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Pi TUI"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Agent Context Editor reads the existing Session and presents User, AI, Reasoning, Answer, and Tool c"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"ontent in an independent management view. Reasoning and final Answers from the same AI turn remain s"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"eparately manageable, while related Tool Calls and Tool Results remain paired."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Visual changes and model-context changes are stored separately. Visual hiding only changes the Conte"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"xt Editor view. Confirmed context exclusion, supported text edits, and applied condensation summarie"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"s change the derived input sent to the model without overwriting the original Session or the host's "},{"id":"p32s4","text":"d input sent to the model without overwriting the original Session or the host's main chat timeline."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Current limitations"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- The plugin does not edit or hide content directly in the host's main chat timeline.\n- Pi Desktop/R"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"PC does not support model-context exclusion or text editing.\n- Reasoning, Tool, System, attachment, "},{"id":"p34s3","text":"structured User, and signed Answer content cannot be edited.\n- Batch text replacement is not support"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"ed.\n- Visual hiding does not change model input or reduce token usage.\n- There is no separate hide-a"},{"id":"p34s5","text":"ll operation; restore-all is available.\n- AI condensation is available in Pi TUI and DeepSeek Harnes"},{"id":"p34s6","text":"s, but not Pi Desktop/RPC; whole-session automatic cleanup is not included.\n- DeepSeek Harness compa"},{"id":"p34s7","text":"tibility is limited to the tested host boundaries documented in COMPATIBILITY.md."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
